Project root: /tmp/wonderland-m25-pomodoro-v6
Directive:    Build a pomodoro tracker. Users start a 25-minute focus session, get a notification when it ends, then take a 5-minute break. Sessions are saved to a personal history that the user can review (today's count, this week, all-time). Settings let the user adjust session and break lengths. No auth — single-user local app, but design with a real database so multi-user can be added later.
Runner:       budget=$6.00 cap, timeout=off (turn-based, no wall-clock cap), quiescence_fallback=300s

